        summary: "Rows of old precursor hulls with the Grown's growth wound through them and the Grown's dead among them, a rammer and a thornback keeping them.",
        description: "Far more to salvage than an ordinary graveyard, in precursor parts and Grown tissue alike. The two that keep it are calm until you strip a hull or open fire.",
        lore: "The hulls were parked in rows long before the groves reached them. The groves were patient.",
